Package: stanworkflow
Title: Declarative Bayesian Workflow for Hand-Written 'Stan' Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Shay", "Ofir-Geva", , "shinofir@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7871-2778"))
Description: Wraps 'cmdstanr' in a declarative compile, prior predictive,
    fit, diagnose and infer pipeline for user-written 'Stan' models. The
    'Stan' data block is filled from a data frame by naming convention,
    each step checkpoints to disk so interrupted runs resume, and posterior
    contrasts (descriptive or counterfactual, one- or two-way) are computed
    from posterior predictive or generated-quantity draws.
